WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.975
Environment Climate Accountability.

00:00:02.925 --> 00:00:20.525
The generation that rationed tin, planted victory gardens, and stewarded the land for their children now watches politicians fly private jets to climate summits, buy a pipeline for $34 billion, and miss every single emissions target — while taxing the farmers who feed the country.

00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:23.075
This is not climate denial.

00:00:23.075 --> 00:00:25.662
This is a demand for receipts .

00:00:25.662 --> 00:00:27.350
Every dollar.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:29.187
Every promise.

00:00:29.187 --> 00:00:31.000
Every failure.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:42.087
Exposed with official data from the Auditor General, Parliamentary Budget Officer, Environment Commissioner, ECCC, Statistics Canada, and Supreme Court rulings.
